Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:51:42 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 98/99] Memory safety net and diagnostics for Create-a-Wrestler
 (GitHub #31)

Thread stacks fall back to the ordinary guest range when the stack arena is
exhausted (a failed thread creation left the game waiting on workers that
never started). Guest allocation failures, heap summaries and thread
create/free are logged and included in the exit/freeze report.
